# Menus: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_Menus.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
setup foot &
wait 2
ptr glide 120 15 300
ptr click
wait 0.6
shot window-menu
note Window menu with Float etc.
setup hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.float({ action = "toggle" })'
wait 1
shot live
note "Float" changed its check while the menu stayed open
key -k Escape

look glass
setup foot &
wait 2
ptr glide 120 15 300
ptr click
wait 0.6
shot window-menu
note Window menu with Float etc.
setup hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.float({ action = "toggle" })'
wait 1
shot live
note "Float" changed its check while the menu stayed open
key -k Escape
